B.bEw=s(["Administrasyon platf\xf2m lan mande ent\xe8n\xe8t. Estatistik yo pa gen done p\xe8son\xe8l manm yo.","L\u2019administration plateforme n\xe9cessite Internet. Les statistiques ne contiennent aucune donn\xe9e personnelle des membres.","Platform administration requires Internet. Statistics contain no member personal data."],t.s)
B.bMF=s(["Kreye sal sa a ak yon nouvo kont pwopriyet\xe8? Verifye im\xe8l la epi transm\xe8t modpas inisyal la atrav\xe8 yon kanal sekirize.","Cr\xe9er cette salle et un nouveau compte propri\xe9taire ? V\xe9rifiez l\u2019email et transmettez le mot de passe initial par un canal s\xe9curis\xe9.","Create this gym and a new owner account? Verify the email and share the initial password through a secure channel."],t.s)
B.btw=s(["Kreye kont p\xe8son\xe8l sa a? Verifye im\xe8l la epi transm\xe8t modpas inisyal la atrav\xe8 yon kanal sekirize.","Cr\xe9er ce compte de personnel ? V\xe9rifiez l\u2019email et transmettez le mot de passe initial par un canal s\xe9curis\xe9.","Create this staff account? Verify the email and share the initial password through a secure channel."],t.s)
B.bpm=s(["Yon demann deja k\xf2manse. Done yo bloke pou evite doublon. Antre modpas inisyal la ank\xf2 epi reprann; modpas sa a pa chanje yon kont ki deja kreye.","Une demande a d\xe9j\xe0 commenc\xe9. Les donn\xe9es sont verrouill\xe9es pour \xe9viter un doublon. Ressaisissez le mot de passe initial et reprenez ; cela ne change pas le mot de passe d\u2019un compte d\xe9j\xe0 cr\xe9\xe9.","A request is already in progress. Details are locked to prevent duplicates. Re-enter the initial password and resume; this does not change the password of an already-created account."],t.s)
B.bPw=s(["Sal la ak kont pwopriyet\xe8 a kreye.","La salle et le compte propri\xe9taire sont cr\xe9\xe9s.","The gym and owner account have been created."],t.s)
