B.bEB=s(["Bloke sal sa a? Apar\xe8y ki konekte yo ap p\xe8di aks\xe8 l\xe8 yo kontakte s\xe8v\xe8 a. Apar\xe8y offline yo rete limite pa otorizasyon offline yo.","Bloquer cette salle ? Les appareils connect\xe9s perdront l\u2019acc\xe8s au prochain contact serveur. Les appareils hors ligne restent limit\xe9s par leur autorisation locale.","Block this gym? Connected devices lose access at the next server contact. Offline devices remain limited by their local authorization lease."],t.s)
B.brR=s(["P\xe8m\xe8t sal sa a konekte epi senkronize ank\xf2?","Autoriser cette salle \xe0 se connecter et \xe0 synchroniser \xe0 nouveau ?","Allow this gym to connect and synchronize again?"],t.s)
B.bIi=s(["Achivaj la bloke sal la epi retire li nan lis aktif la. Istorik la kons\xe8ve. Antre k\xf2d sal la pou konfime.","L\u2019archivage bloque la salle et la retire de la liste active. L\u2019historique est conserv\xe9. Saisissez son code pour confirmer.","Archiving blocks the gym and removes it from the active list. History is retained. Enter its code to confirm."],t.s)
B.br1=s(["K\xf2d sal la pou konfime","Code de la salle pour confirmer","Gym code to confirm"],t.s)
B.bQU=s(["Reyinisyalize modpas","R\xe9initialiser le mot de passe","Reset password"],t.s)
B.bNB=s(["Voye yon im\xe8l reyinisyalizasyon bay pwopriyet\xe8 sal sa a?","Envoyer un email de r\xe9initialisation au propri\xe9taire de cette salle ?","Send a password reset email to this gym\u2019s owner?"],t.s)
