B.aW8=s(["Apre anrejistreman anprent lan, ekran aks\xe8 a senkronize t\xe8minal la otomatikman (oswa peze \xab Senkronize sou t\xe8minal la \xbb).","Apr\xe8s l\u2019enregistrement, l\u2019\xe9cran d\u2019acc\xe8s synchronise le terminal automatiquement (ou touchez \xab Synchroniser le terminal \xbb).","After enrollment, the access screen syncs the terminal automatically (or tap \u201cSync terminal\u201d)."],t.s)
